<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on RWE AG.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on RWE AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued three million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on RWE AG shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.NOV.96-01.JUL.98   PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  65.0 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE	 ISSUE	 PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 62.O DEM     7.40 DEM    6.77 PCT   8.78 X</p>
<p> CALL	 67.0 DEM     5.00 DEM    10.77 PCT  13.0 X</p>
<p> CALL	 72.0 DEM     3.30 DEM    15.85 PCT  19.70 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
